<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND WIN FIRST ONE-DAYER BY SIX WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND WIN FIRST ONE-DAYER BY SIX WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>LEEDS, England 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>England beat Australia by six wickets in the first one-day international at Headingley on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 170-8 (50 overs), England 175-4 (40.1).</p>
</text>
